  "question": {
    "text": "The number of moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;that must be added to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>80</mn><msub><mi>MAgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> in order to reduce the concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ag</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;ions to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mfenced close=\"\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mtext>formation&#160;</mtext></msub></mfenced></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Ag</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> is __________. (Nearest integer)<br />[Assume no volume change on adding <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>]",
    "image": null
